"""Committed SPF v0.2 factored tan-tanh pair-adder ROM.

Five 1-D integer tables for the factored complex pair adder (blog post
2026-09-30-135722, finding 1).  Generated by
``scripts/generate_spf_factored_add_rom.py`` with 60-digit mpmath and
round-to-nearest, ties-to-even, so the arithmetic is reproducible without
depending on host ``libm``.  Values are in *guard units* (``2^-12`` ticks).

The ``LP`` table is ``256 log2(1 + 2^{-g/256})`` -- the same Gaussian log as the
v0.2 ``logadd_pos`` ROM but at guard precision for the factored coupling.  It is
NOT a replacement for ``logadd_pos``: the exact phase classes (same/opposite
phase, equal magnitude, quadrature) still dispatch through
``spf.tensor.v02._pair_local`` and the canonical Lambda+/- ROMs so those stay
bit-exact.
"""

